{
  "_about": "Form field -> where its value comes from. \"document.X\" = X read from the subscriber's KYC documents (see ../document-data-dictionary.json); \"|surname\" etc. = the part of it this box wants; \"typed\" = from the batch Excel or the review screen; \"default.X\" = usually X, the Excel can change it; \"copy.X\" = same as field X unless typed separately; \"today\" = today's date; \"tick\" = a tick box.",
